    OcdCarrierSettingsDataset (OCD rule round 31): CarrierSettings posts one notification of its
    own, for a stop event it raises itself (a failed restore of the temporary emergency APN set, a
    reboot with that set in place, a second voice loss under the same values). Status carries the
    same notice for the OCD app.
-->
<exceptions>
    <exception package="com.android.carriersettings">
        <permission name="android.permission.POST_NOTIFICATIONS" fixed="false"/>
    </exception>
</exceptions>
